From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:31:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/32] source-packages: recognize Node.js 26 metadata

Accept and serialize 26 through the existing NodeVersion contract. Keep
runtime installation and executable selection separate from source-package
metadata so this support can be replaced by upstream independently.

Document adoption ordering and the old-reader rollback limitation for
operators. Existing version values and records retain their meaning; no
migration is required to install the patch.
---
 crates/model/src/source_packages/types.rs |  5 ++++-
 patches/node26_source_metadata/README.md  | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 patches/node26_source_metadata/README.md

diff --git a/crates/model/src/source_packages/types.rs b/crates/model/src/source_packages/types.rs
index 94e21683e884c27466c24192903786ef02c980dc..65eda615ca0c9f089a314bc4557a795241cfe505 100644
--- a/crates/model/src/source_packages/types.rs
+++ b/crates/model/src/source_packages/types.rs
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@ pub enum NodeVersion {
     V20x,
     V22x,
     V24x,
+    V26x,
 }
 
 impl NodeVersion {
@@ -53,7 +54,7 @@ impl NodeVersion {
                     )
                 ));
             },
-            NodeVersion::V22x | NodeVersion::V24x => Ok(()),
